{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b90d7536b0064c328cb0db0dd39306fa32bb7e3bc08024db1ce8ddbbe7e432c1", "ja": "（今日は未来の新曲PV撮影だ！\n前日から未来はやる気満々で、撮影に挑んだが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄未来的新歌PV！未来从前一天起就干劲十足地投入了拍摄，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "8e0788d4fd892aca477fa45aa135235d6f55556888d64b8b4f648aeb63549c30", "ja": "う～ん……やっぱり手の角度がよくなかったのかな？\nもしかして、走り方がヘンだったりして……。", "zh": "嗯……果然还是手的角度不太对吗？\n该不会是跑步的姿势很奇怪吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f325b5dcbdb8cd83bab28e58a0a8b7c4e160071f254f0565e4f795551ff19dba", "ja": "お疲れ様、未来。\n何度も走るシーンをやり直してるけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "辛苦了，未来。\n跑步的场景已经重拍好几次了，没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "f678e38fc4f2974ce8ef43fa2fef3976527756b85e31f63695c1a0491c5a0b90", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\n私は大丈夫ですけど……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n我没事，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "fc92ac8c5ffca635e9a896b182399f918121033e1103f6091b98a958c1a79731", "ja": "スタッフさん達、疲れたって顔をしてて。\nそれって、私のせいですよね……？", "zh": "工作人员们都露出疲惫的表情。\n那都是我的错吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "3bccd94356d798ffe2c4b650178d30f1da0bdf9a02d4161e25a104bea04e249a", "ja": "みんなに迷惑かけるつもりじゃなかったのに……。", "zh": "我明明没打算给大家添麻烦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1006_p", "source_sha256": "503837e8ce19f3cdc84f4b03c6a2475d7d7801079bf76ce446b987ae45c5d92a", "ja": "未来……。\nとりあえず、今は休憩だ。少し休もう。", "zh": "未来……\n总之，现在先休息一下。稍微休息会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "cacb8972414107ba466524c66ebb557a2a3c7d1d94a219f8e83b45a82137281c", "ja": "はーい……。ふぅ。", "zh": "好——。呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9a09508562483a90c1efff54b2956e7a322c4169a23c7ee90be15931f817815b", "ja": "そういえば、昨日からやる気満々だったな？\n台本も読み込んでたみたいだし。", "zh": "说起来，你从昨天开始就干劲十足啊？\n好像连剧本都认真读过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "db4ae699cb7c360b2cb0f5e07565938d57a10f84f30f9dcb812c50960be6fb28", "ja": "はい！　私の曲だから、素敵なPVにしたくて。\n春香さんも「がんばって」って応援してくれたんです！", "zh": "是的！因为这是我的歌曲，所以想把它拍成精彩的PV。\n春香小姐也为我加油，说“要加油哦”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "1ad9bbfc39ff075ddf20a1bd48051609b9e5bdc12f03b1631bd566024ce1dbca", "ja": "でもでも……私、NGいっぱいで……あぅぅ。", "zh": "可是可是……我有好多NG……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2130c901487215fce8687aad53a899ac819de2b78f378f27d53972db48992418", "ja": "み、未来！？　えっと……少し落ち着こうか。\nほら、深呼吸してみよう！", "zh": "未、未来！？那个……我们先冷静一下吧。\n来，试着深呼吸一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "44e5c594e3f2f7e1816e3932d5fb9b712e29bfc029c793be7064cd2ee30f8fbe", "ja": "ううっ……。\nすぅー、はぁー……すうっ、はぁー……。", "zh": "呜呜……。\n呼——、吸——……呼，吸——……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3301db7ed39c68768ca7e2d766dba9fc5594c5bb52df0ed2c24bbd506ae63574", "ja": "スタッフさん達も、未来と同じ気持ちだと思うよ。\n素敵なPVにしたいって。", "zh": "我觉得工作人员们也和未来有着同样的心情。  \n都希望能拍出精彩的PV。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bc152fdfa45704eb81bdf489f52983a8405a1c54f62df88638817b45dccc825b", "ja": "未来なら素敵な瞬間が撮れるって、信じてる。\nスタッフさんも俺も。", "zh": "我相信未来一定能拍出精彩的瞬间。\n工作人员和我都这么相信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "610bb4912e0eb9b49f4630fc1ad360e4c6613820b13bb57c570a26017c5791db", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n私、できると思いますか……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n您觉得，我能做到吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f400a6e0fbc50ce6fda94d107ac3b23ae25f3d010c0cf8f5f5573c37787ad419", "ja": "もちろん。何度挑戦してもいい。\n未来は自分を信じて、納得がいくまでやってみろ！", "zh": "当然可以。无论挑战多少次都没关系。\n未来，相信自己，直到做到满意为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "dd5aa34c81173cbe11e9202b743231914b8fc11f5316ed9d59e426cf3c33da45", "ja": "私を、信じて……。", "zh": "请相信我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "34738462d86ccaba3f1a2c34e2d2b4cc124aaa15ffcd6ad2d5fb5398909fa9ee", "ja": "私、もう一度がんばってみます！　うん、やるぞ～！\n……あっ！　あの、ひとつお願いが……。", "zh": "我要再努力一次！嗯，加油——！\n……啊！那个，我有一个请求……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ea62177209815d06bcf87e6b0627824a5d0b8f7431ec433b0572216928a1ec4e", "ja": "（未来がスタッフさん達に話がしたいということで\n撮影が再開する前に少しだけ時間をもらった……）", "zh": "（未来说想和工作人员们谈谈，所以在拍摄重新开始前，抽出了一点时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "0ca6bbcabc69863ed1f2920c1c88efab8b0ca221c35c41b60250a0ddf1d52c38", "ja": "えっと……スタッフのみなさん、お疲れさまです！\n何度もNG出しちゃって、ごめんなさい！　でも……。", "zh": "那个……各位工作人员，辛苦了！\n让大家一次次重拍NG，对不起！但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "78b04efb10f545e480e4074b6867eeb7475f7133960fe71d1800a9d0b0361266", "ja": "素敵なPVにしたいって思ってるんです！　だから、\nみなさんの力を貸してください！　お願いしますっ！", "zh": "我想拍出精彩的PV！所以，请大家助我一臂之力！拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1022_kantoku", "source_sha256": "dfdf0e42ea1bb1b7fc4e8ea1d6de0d878b6481cf280165442caa997ea2a24ed2", "ja": "もちろんだよ、春日さん！\n一緒にイイPVを作ろう！", "zh": "当然啦，春日小姐！  \n一起制作精彩的PV吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "e7442de546a5b58f3434bf4a386d91d03936471ecee7d77328fb0450d884d509", "ja": "……はいっ！　よろしくお願いします！\n春日未来、全力でがんばりますっ！　えへへ♪", "zh": "……好的！请多指教！\n春日未来，我会全力以赴的！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0354_1024_p", "source_sha256": "e92dcc7728132dfad58ec08e54fe35bd022ae8d7beb500ad0d077e8629cb4f89", "ja": "（気持ちがひとつになった後の撮影は、順調に進んだ。\n撮影終了後の未来は、最高の笑顔をしていた……）", "zh": "（大家心意相通之后，拍摄进行得很顺利。\n拍摄结束后的未来，脸上露出了最棒的笑容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
